Whitney Carson's father-in-law Kevin  McCallister died on Thursday night at  the age of 57 after battling cancer for  two years  the Dancing with the Stars pros shared  the sad news on Instagram posting this  pic with Kevin and her husband Carson  writing in part quote we are so grateful  for the time we've had with him on this  earth and we know he's in a better place  until we meet again just last weekend  the 24 year old and her family threw a  birthday party for Kevin and documented  the celebration on Instagram a day  earlier the dancer shared this pic along  with an emotional update on his health  quote we are devastated to share that  Kevin's body is no longer able to  tolerate treatment  he's on hospice and we are just  cherishing every moment we have with him  in December Whitney announced that she  would be pulling out of the Dancing with  the Stars winter tour to be by her  husband's side during this difficult  time and just last week she shared a  heartwarming video of Kevin spending  time with his family  writing enjoying all the time we get  with him
 

